Notice — Metadata-Only Application
==================================

This CC0 license covers ONLY the metadata files listed above. It does
NOT grant rights to the NES ROM files (.nes) within this repository.
Each ROM retains its own license as declared in LICENSES.md.

Nature of this repository
-------------------------

This repository is a long-term **1:1 mirror** of third-party NES test ROMs,
actively curated by @Laffinty (OWNER) for the FCEUX11 / F11QA test
infrastructure. OWNER is a **custodian**, not the creator, of the ROM
bytes contained herein. All copyright and attribution rights in each
ROM remain with its respective upstream author. Upstream authors are
**not** contributors to this repository; OWNER is **not** affiliated
with, sponsored by, or acting on behalf of any upstream author.

Takedown (informal)
-------------------

If you are an upstream author or a rights-holder and wish a ROM to be
removed, please open an issue (preferred) or contact @Laffinty via
GitHub. Removal is implemented on a best-effort, no-questions-asked
basis within 24 hours of identity verification, for maintainer safety.
Full takedown policy: see `README.md §收录与法律声明 §5`.

Takedown (formal / GitHub DMCA)
-------------------------------

For a formal takedown, please contact GitHub directly at
<https://github.com/contact/dmca>. OWNER will cooperate with GitHub's
compliance process but does **not** operate as a U.S. DMCA Service
Provider and does **not** independently maintain a DMCA
notice-and-takedown infrastructure.

Trademarks
----------

All upstream author names, handles, ROM names, and trademarks
referenced in this repository or in `LICENSES.md` are the property of
their respective owners. Their use here is purely factual attribution
and does **not** imply endorsement, partnership, or sponsorship.
No upstream trademark right is granted by this CC0 dedication or by the
inclusion of any ROM in this repository.

